Parts of Go's standard library that the CELExtensions target needs are ported
there under the same Go BSD notice: Sources/CELExtensions/GoStrings.swift
(strings, unicode.IsSpace), GoFloat.swift (strconv float formatting),
NetIP.swift (net/netip) and the Base64 codec in Encoders.swift
(encoding/base64). In the CEL target, Sources/CEL/Values/GoFormat.swift and
GoParse.swift port Go's strconv float formatting and parsing, and
Sources/CEL/Stdlib/TZif.swift ports the TZif reader of Go's time package
(zoneinfo_read.go), under the same notice.

Sources/CEL/Parser/ANTLR ports the parts of the ANTLR 4 Go runtime
(https://github.com/antlr4-go/antlr, v4.13.1) that cel-go's generated parser
uses for prediction and error recovery, and Sources/CEL/Common/GoStrconv.swift
and GoIsPrintTables.swift port Go's strconv quoting and printability tables
(Go BSD notice above).

